<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE- DSM Q2 net profit 242 mln guilders.</title>
<headline>TABLE- DSM Q2 net profit 242 mln guilders.</headline>
<dateline>HEERLEN, Netherlands 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second quarter 1997</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit incl. extraordinary items     242  vs 208 loss</p>
<p>    Extraordinary items			    nil  vs nil</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)			   3.13  vs  2.59</p>
<p>    Operating profit				 338  vs 288</p>
<p>    Interest charges				  18  vs  14</p>
<p>    Tax						  100  vs  80</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast DSM NV's second quarter net profit at 214-321 million guilders. Consensus was 250 million.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 570 8500</p>
</text>
